    "id": "M21",
    "title_zh": "知识与生活：相连的哲学候选",
    "title_en": "Knowing and living: connected philosophical proposal",
    "claim_zh": "认识的内容、根据、错误、标准与模型修订已形成相连候选；充分解释须保存使证据与纠正成立的实际依存。G0赋予生及继续生成基本正面意义，不要求其独占每一种价值的根据；相容仍须在同一整体中实现全部承诺。",
    "claim_en": "Content, grounds, error, standards and model revision form a connected account; adequate explanation preserves the actual dependencies of evidence and correction. G0 gives life and further generation basic positive significance without requiring an exclusive ground for every value; compatibility still requires a joint realization of the commitments.",
    "scope_zh": "继续评估新增8项 Lean 定理／11项空依赖审计：指定界面的全观点相容等价于覆盖其可容许画像，完整真实另需不变性等根据；这不是G0反模型。价值范围及整套理论必要性仍未证。保留前轮13／18、模型修订30／72及76次执行、来源26／53、选择性修订16／32和四项统计复核原范围。原典对手、真实损失与G0/J公理路线保留；无新实验或独立验收，普遍语义与意识仍开放。",
    "scope_en": "Continuation adds 8 Lean theorems/11 empty dependency audits: compatibility with all claims at a specified profile is equivalent to admissible-profile coverage; full truth needs further warrant such as invariance. These are not G0 countermodels. Value scope and whole-theory necessity remain unproved. Prior 13/18, model revision 30/72 and 76 runs, source reliance 26/53, selective revision 16/32 and four-statistic checks retain their scopes. Primary rivals, real losses and G0/J remain; no new experiment or independent acceptance. Universal semantics and consciousness remain open.",
