  "entry_after": {
    "id": "M21",
    "title_zh": "知识与生活：相连的哲学候选",
    "title_en": "Knowing and living: connected philosophical proposal",
    "claim_zh": "认识、纠正与模型修订构成相连候选；新关系与理解也可形成新的目的和关切。G0赋予生及继续生成基本正面意义而不要求独占价值根据。实际关系、意识范围、已有生命的地位、进一步形成的理由及共同实践须分别说明，同时保留整体依存与真实损失。",
    "claim_en": "Knowing, correction and model revision form a connected account; new relationships and understanding can also form new purposes and concern. G0 gives life and further generation basic positive significance without exclusive value grounding. Actual relations, conscious scope, standing, reasons for further formation and practical response need distinct accounts within whole dependence and real loss.",
    "scope_zh": "新哲学比较追踪目的形成，核读Korsgaard与Taylor；更强对手可接受真实关系而把最终善联系于有意识的生活。跨范围正面根据及整套理论必要性仍未证，无新定理、实验或独立验收。保留界面相容8／11、一般相容13／18、模型修订30／72及76次执行、来源26／53、选择性修订16／32与四项统计复核原范围。G0/J公理路线不重开；普遍语义与意识仍开放。",
    "scope_en": "New philosophical comparison develops purpose formation and reads Korsgaard and Taylor; a stronger rival accepts actual relations while locating final good in conscious lives. Cross-scope positive warrant and whole-theory necessity remain unproved. No new theorem, experiment or independent acceptance. Profile compatibility 8/11, general compatibility 13/18, model revision 30/72 and 76 runs, source reliance 26/53, selective revision 16/32 and four-statistic checks retain their scopes. G0/J is not reopened; universal semantics and consciousness remain open.",
